%% Valtide — Request lifecycle sequence (FR3 strategy + FR4 analogs)
%% Traces one user request end-to-end. FR1 (news-check) and FR2 (scan)
%% follow the same UI -> BFF -> agent path; FR2 is a zero-LLM branch.
%% Source: valtide-ui/src/api/client.ts, bff-nestjs/src/agent/agent.client.ts,
%%         bff correlation.middleware.ts, agent-fastapi/app/api/routes.py,
%%         app/services/strategy_service.py, app/adapters/llm_adapter.py
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Investor
    participant UI as valtide-ui (React)
    participant BFF as BFF (NestJS :8080)
    participant AG as Agent (FastAPI :8000)
    participant Y as Yahoo Finance
    participant LLM as LLM Provider
    participant EN as Engine (factors / analogs)

    U->>UI: pick ticker in Strategy Studio
    UI->>BFF: POST /api/v1/strategy (symbol, newsLabel)
    Note over BFF: CorrelationMiddleware mints X-Correlation-Id<br/>ValidationPipe validates DTO
    BFF->>AG: POST /internal/v1/strategy<br/>headers: X-Internal-Token, X-Correlation-Id

    Note over AG: bind correlation id
    AG->>Y: fetch market data (httpx)
    Y-->>AG: OHLCV + P/E (synthetic fallback on failure)
    AG->>EN: compute factors + composite score
    EN-->>AG: evidence block

    Note over AG: framing neutralization + sufficiency gate
    AG->>LLM: complete_json(FR3_STRATEGY, evidence)
    LLM-->>AG: structured strategy (Buy/Wait/Avoid)
    Note over AG: coherence validator<br/>(bounded regenerate-or-fail, MAX=1)
    AG->>EN: match_analogs (isolated, partial-failure safe)
    EN-->>AG: analog matches
    Note over AG: release gate: language linter + traceability

    AG-->>BFF: 200 (strategy, analogs, disclaimers)
    BFF-->>UI: 200 JSON (or taxonomy error passthrough)
    UI-->>U: render plan + analogs + disclaimer

    Note over U,EN: On failure a DomainError code+message+correlation_id propagates unchanged<br/>as 404 / 422 / 502 / 503. INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE is a 200 body-state.
